 "lab": {
  "title": "Беспроводная сеть",
  "text": "Точка доступа AP1 подключена к R1, на R1 уже работает DHCP для сети 192.168.50.0/24.\n\n1. Настройте на **AP1** сеть `OFFICE` с WPA2 и ключом `Office2026` (окно устройства → «Настройка»).\n2. Подключите ноутбуки к сети OFFICE (Desktop → Wi-Fi или `netsh wlan connect`) и включите DHCP.\n3. Проверьте доступ ноутбуков к шлюзу 192.168.50.1.",
  "checks": [
   "wifi Laptop1 OFFICE | Laptop1 подключён к OFFICE",
   "wifi Laptop2 OFFICE | Laptop2 подключён к OFFICE",
   "dhcp Laptop1 | Laptop1 получил адрес",
   "ping Laptop2 192.168.50.1 | Laptop2 видит шлюз"
  ],
  "translations": {
   "en": {
    "title": "Wireless network",
    "text": "Access point AP1 is connected to R1, which already runs DHCP for 192.168.50.0/24.\n\n1. On **AP1** set up the network `OFFICE` with WPA2 and the key `Office2026` (device window → Config).\n2. Connect the laptops to OFFICE (Wi-Fi settings or `netsh wlan connect`) and enable DHCP.\n3. Check that the laptops reach the gateway 192.168.50.1.",
    "checks": [
     "Laptop1 joined OFFICE",
     "Laptop2 joined OFFICE",
     "Laptop1 got an address",
     "Laptop2 reaches the gateway"
    ]
   }
  },
  "script": {
   "AP1": "@ssid OFFICE key Office2026",
   "Laptop1": "@wifi OFFICE Office2026\n@dhcp",
   "Laptop2": "@wifi OFFICE Office2026\n@dhcp"
  }
 }
}